                <pb facs="0448" n="368" xml:id="pg368"/>

                <head>Treaty between the United States and the Kingdom of Denmark for the
                    extradition of fugitives from justice.</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, January 6, 1902.<lb/>Ratification
                        advised by the Senate, January 30, 1902.<lb/>Ratified by the President,
                        February 26, 1902.<lb/>Ratified by Denmark, March 8, 1902.<lb/>Ratifications
                        exchanged at Washington, April 16, 1902.<lb/>Proclaimed, April 17,
                    1902</hi>.</p>

